ion_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","content_hash":"701ca817e9ffaf3bfdfd3219ef02b7e82f3d59cb7b3b09a89e40f4b06560efba","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","text":"(2) Operate an electric-assisted scooter at a speed in excess of 15 miles per hour;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"2728c75e-e73d-5e6f-9a4b-d3f5f7a4f196"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","content_hash":"1903d0da15e70039e7ece5d5200170e5b25406c00711e1e67bf7fc0d2d4e9e62","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","text":"(3) Fail to yield the right-of-way to pedestrians and/or give an audible signal before overtaking and passing pedestrians;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"547d908c-3561-5f17-9ee8-9856ce57c4d2"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","content_hash":"e740a278faf219edc8ac07dc63b512678da2e904108f3ca8ead4f3e0a401dc64","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","text":"(4) Fail to comply with Shawnee County resolutions governing County park property, including the regional multi-use trails;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"0e3021d8-a60b-59ef-a74b-1e7e82237096"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","content_hash":"100f655e787586dd99e5fabdd6ae82d2e919064208cb3f8ca68d07f20a515557","heading":null,"ordinal":8,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:8","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","text":"(5) Fail to remain alert and give full attention to the safe operation of the scooter while in motion;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"240e774b-a39b-582f-8685-f48c712a8715"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","content_hash":"c1f7dc2dd43edda8dc770187c4732dbb9822f593529ff9472cd3265ef583cb03","heading":null,"ordinal":9,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:9","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","text":"(6) Engage in any activity that interferes with the safe operation of the scooter; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"42110a9e-3ce8-5a0c-be08-14bd745243eb"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","content_hash":"c2f8e0293b36927dd106eaabf55d27d162b748afdd36fb44ac2b7945f4118a1c","heading":null,"ordinal":10,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:10","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","text":"(7) Operate the electric-assisted scooter in such a manner as to indicate a careless or heedless disregard for the rights or safety of others, or in such a manner as to endanger, or be likely to endanger, any person or property.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"fcee6279-a3cd-5f6a-95a8-f71c6b86eec0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","content_hash":"08003f39497e9950e2d3bbb477683d1cfd45b65cc40d7df6fb26117ad91885c2","heading":null,"ordinal":11,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:11","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","text":"(e) The Municipal Judge shall establish a schedule of fines to be imposed for violations of this section. The fines shall not exceed the amount established for traffic infractions related to the operation of bicycles. (Ord. 20178 § 3, 4-9-19.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"49cd92bd-9422-5e84-a952-df142d4a2ea0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","content_hash":"a9bf8afbcf63b91f44dd6a6cf4c368e2da73d55be044a1c023de95b87e51846a","heading":null,"ordinal":12,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:12","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.040","text":"Cross References: Municipal Judge, TMC 2.20.060 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"81b02d83-d904-52e6-8e06-b3c296d7c1d4"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}